Z||000000||3.8T Fiero GT||11-07-2001||08:05 PM|||| <A HREF="http://www.sdsefi.com/specific.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.sdsefi.com/specific.html</A> <P>I am going with this aftermarket fuel system to run the turbo motor properly, it's an ALL in one system that will run EVERYTHING and "everything" is the key word here  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Question is- Does anybody know of another fuel management system for turbo setups that comes close to this package for the price??? <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_watchout.gif">  BTW, this system comes from Canada so shipping is WAY easier and cheaper.  I dont mind going thru the US as usual though.  The system costs $1200 USD.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://cache.ucr.edu/~currie/turbo-t.jpg">  <BR><B>"A 3.8T makes and excellent "RICE" cooker"</B>||||reg||1
